        "id": 82532,
        "name": "Oaktree",
        "username": "Oaktree",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/{size}/2287_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-13T03:16:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Katsue\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/48/2012_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Katsue:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Get Out of the Way isn't great against Iron Legacy, unless you're in the Final Wasteland or something.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Yes. Confusing it with \"Know When To Turn Lose\".&nbsp; Need to verify card effects before I hit \"SAVE\".&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
